<article id="entry-abyssos-bdag" class="entry-card" data-dictionary="grego" hidden data-source="BDAG">
            <header class="entry-header">
                <div>
                    <h1 class="entry-title greek">ἄβυσσος</h1>
                    <div class="entry-meta">
                        <span class="greek">ου</span>
                        <span class="separator">·</span>
                        <span class="article greek">ἡ</span>
                        <span class="separator">·</span>
                        <span class="transliteration">⟦ábussos⟧</span>
                        <span class="separator">·</span>
                        <span>substantivo</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="source-tag">BDAG</div>
            </header>

            <div class="entry-divider"></div>

            <section class="entry-section">
                <div class="section-title">Tradução literal</div>

                <p class="entry-text">
                    (originalmente adjetivo, Ésquilo, Heródoto em diante; assim também
                    <a class="reference reference-link" href="https://www.die-bibel.de/en/bible/LXX/DEU.33.13" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Dt 33.13</a>.
                    O singular feminino é usado frequentemente na LXX, com artigo ou adjetivo:
                    <a class="reference reference-link" href="https://www.die-bibel.de/en/bible/LXX/GEN.1.2" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Gn 1.2</a>;
                    <a class="reference reference-link" href="https://www.die-bibel.de/en/bible/LXX/JOB.41.23" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jó 41.23</a>;
                    <a class="reference reference-link" href="https://www.die-bibel.de/en/bible/LXX/PSA.77.15" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Sl 77.15</a>;
                    <a class="reference reference-link" href="https://www.die-bibel.de/en/bible/LXX/AMO.7.4" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Am 7.4</a>;
                    também Enoque, passim;
                    <span class="biblio-ref tooltip-trigger" tabindex="0" data-tooltip-type="biblio" data-tooltip-label="TestSol 2:8 BC" data-tooltip-text="Testamento de Salomão 2.8, testemunhos B e C">TestSol 2:8 BC</span>;
                    TestJob 33:6;
                    TestLevi 3:9 v.l.;
                    JosAs 12:3, 10;
                    4 Esdr 8:23 Fgm. c;
                    ApcEsdr 4:21 p. 28, 24 Tdf.;
                    Justino, <em>A I</em> 60, 9
                    [por
                    <span class="greek greek-term tooltip-trigger" tabindex="0" data-tooltip-type="greek" data-tooltip-label="ᾅδου" data-meanings="Hades; mundo dos mortos">ᾅδου</span>
                    em
                    <a class="reference reference-link" href="https://www.die-bibel.de/en/bible/LXX/DEU.32.22" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Dt 32.22</a>];
                    sem artigo ou adjetivo na LXX;
                    Melito, <em>P.</em> 28, 614.
                    O plural feminino, com artigo ou adjetivo:
                    <a class="reference reference-link" href="https://www.die-bibel.de/en/bible/LXX/PSA.134.6" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Sl 134.6</a>;
                    <a class="reference reference-link" href="https://www.die-bibel.de/en/bible/LXX/PSA.148.7" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">148.7</a>;
                    <a class="reference reference-link" href="https://www.die-bibel.de/en/bible/LXX/PRO.8.24" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Pv 8.24</a>;
                    TestLevi 3:9;
                    sem artigo ou adjetivo, frequentemente na LXX;
                    PsSol 17:19.)
                    Literalmente, <em>buraco profundo</em>, daí <em>profundidade imensa</em>
                    (Diógenes Laércio 4, 5, 27;
                    Jâmblico, <em>Myst.</em> 6, 5, p. 245, 15 Parthey;
                    <em>Herm. Wr.</em> 3, 1; 16, 5;
                    PGM 1, 343; 3, 554; 4, 1148; 1350; 2835; 7, 261; 517;
                    PWarr 21, 29; 31;
                    LXX;
                    En 21:7;
                    Fílon, <em>Op. M.</em> 29;
                    SibOr 1, 223).

                    <span class="sense-number">1.</span>
                    Um espaço imensamente profundo, <strong>profundidade, abismo</strong>, em geral, contrastado com céu e terra
                    (Did., <em>Gen.</em> 30, 8),
                    <span class="biblio-ref tooltip-trigger" tabindex="0" data-tooltip-type="biblio" data-tooltip-label="1 Cl 28:3" data-tooltip-text="Primeira Epístola de Clemente 28.3">1 Cl 28:3</span>
                    (plural como em
                    <a class="reference reference-link" href="https://www.die-bibel.de/en/bible/LXX/DEU.8.7" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Dt 8.7</a>;
                    <a class="reference reference-link" href="https://www.die-bibel.de/en/bible/LXX/PSA.32.7" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Sl 32.7</a>;
                    <a class="reference reference-link" href="https://www.die-bibel.de/en/bible/LXX/PSA.76.17" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">76.17</a>,
                    entre outras;
                    TestLevi 3:9;
                    <em>Cat. Cod. Astr.</em> VIII/2 p. 173, 29);
                    <span class="biblio-ref tooltip-trigger" tabindex="0" data-tooltip-type="biblio" data-tooltip-label="Dg 7:2" data-tooltip-text="Epístola a Diogneto 7.2">Dg 7:2</span>.
                    Escuro
                    (<a class="reference reference-link" href="https://www.die-bibel.de/en/bible/LXX/GEN.1.2" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Gn 1.2</a>),
                    e por isso insondável ao olho humano,
                    <span class="biblio-ref tooltip-trigger" tabindex="0" data-tooltip-type="biblio" data-tooltip-label="1 Cl 20:5" data-tooltip-text="Primeira Epístola de Clemente 20.5">1 Cl 20:5</span>,
                    e discernível somente por Deus,
                    <span class="biblio-ref tooltip-trigger" tabindex="0" data-tooltip-type="biblio" data-tooltip-label="1 Cl 59:3" data-tooltip-text="Primeira Epístola de Clemente 59.3">59.3</span>
                    (Teófilo de Antioquia 1, 6, p. 70, 23;
                    compare
                    <a class="reference reference-link" href="https://www.die-bibel.de/en/bible/LXX/DAN.3.55" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Dn 3.55</a>,
                    Teodocião).

                    <span class="sense-number">2.</span>
                    Um lugar transcendente associado aos mortos e a poderes hostis, <strong>mundo inferior, abismo</strong>, especialmente a morada dos mortos,
                    <a class="reference reference-link" href="https://www.die-bibel.de/en/bible/NA28/ROM.10.7" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Rm 10.7</a>
                    (<a class="reference reference-link" href="https://www.die-bibel.de/en/bible/LXX/PSA.106.26" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Sl 106.26</a>),
                    e dos demônios,
                    <a class="reference reference-link" href="https://www.die-bibel.de/en/bible/NA28/LUK.8.31" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Lc 8.31</a>;
                    calabouço onde o diabo é mantido,
                    <a class="reference reference-link" href="https://www.die-bibel.de/en/bible/NA28/REV.20.3" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ap 20.3</a>;
                    morada do
                    <span class="greek greek-term tooltip-trigger" tabindex="0" data-tooltip-type="greek" data-tooltip-label="θηρίον" data-meanings="besta|fera">θηρίον</span>,
                    o Anticristo,
                    <a class="reference reference-link" href="https://www.die-bibel.de/en/bible/NA28/REV.11.7" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">11.7</a>;
                    <a class="reference reference-link" href="https://www.die-bibel.de/en/bible/NA28/REV.17.8" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">17.8</a>;
                    de
                    <span class="greek greek-term tooltip-trigger" tabindex="0" data-tooltip-type="greek" data-tooltip-label="Ἀβαδδών" data-meanings="Abadom">Ἀβαδδών</span>
                    (q.v.), o anjo do mundo inferior,
                    <a class="reference reference-link" href="https://www.die-bibel.de/en/bible/NA28/REV.9.11" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">9.11</a>
                    (compare PGM 13, 169 e veja Élio Aristides 38, p. 724 D., sobre Filipe:
                    <span class="greek greek-term tooltip-trigger" tabindex="0" data-tooltip-type="greek" data-tooltip-label="ἀνὴρ ὑβριστὴς ἐκ τοῦ βαράθρου τ. γῆς ὁρμώμενος κακῇ μοίρᾳ τ. Ἑλλήνων" data-meanings="um homem insolente, vindo do abismo da terra para a má sorte dos gregos">ἀνὴρ ὑβριστὴς ἐκ τοῦ βαράθρου τ. γῆς ὁρμώμενος κακῇ μοίρᾳ τ. Ἑλλήνων</span>);
                    <span class="greek greek-term tooltip-trigger" tabindex="0" data-tooltip-type="greek" data-tooltip-label="φρέαρ τῆς ἀ." data-meanings="poço do abismo">φρέαρ τῆς ἀ.</span>,
                    <a class="reference reference-link" href="https://www.die-bibel.de/en/bible/NA28/REV.9.1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">9.1 s.</a>;
                    capaz de ser selado,
                    <a class="reference reference-link" href="https://www.die-bibel.de/en/bible/NA28/REV.9.1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">9.1</a>;
                    <a class="reference reference-link" href="https://www.die-bibel.de/en/bible/NA28/REV.20.1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">20.1</a>,
                    <a class="reference reference-link" href="https://www.die-bibel.de/en/bible/NA28/REV.20.3" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">3</a>.
                    —
                    J. Kroll, <em>Gott u. Hölle</em>, 1932;
                    K. Schneider, <em>RAC</em> I 60–62.
                    —
                    <span class="biblio-ref tooltip-trigger" tabindex="0" data-tooltip-type="biblio" data-tooltip-label="DELG s.v. βυθός" data-tooltip-text="Dictionnaire étymologique de la langue grecque, sob βυθός">DELG, s.v. βυθός</span>.
                    <span class="biblio-ref tooltip-trigger" tabindex="0" data-tooltip-type="biblio" data-tooltip-label="M-M" data-tooltip-text="Moulton-Milligan, The Vocabulary of the Greek Testament">M-M.</span>
                    <span class="biblio-ref tooltip-trigger" tabindex="0" data-tooltip-type="biblio" data-tooltip-label="TW" data-tooltip-text="Theologisches Wörterbuch zum Neuen Testament">TW.</span>
                    <span class="biblio-ref tooltip-trigger" tabindex="0" data-tooltip-type="biblio" data-tooltip-label="Sv." data-tooltip-text="Referência abreviada conforme BDAG">Sv.</span>
                </p>
            </section>
        </article>

